/*
:name: spec_syntax_tick_step_lambda_name
:type: error
:error: 'step' is reserved, so it cannot be a name
:help: backticks
*/
// Owner ruling 99 (spec-audit Q42): `tick`/`step` are reserved everywhere,
// also as a lambda or method name ("no special thing for methods"): write
// comb `step`(...).
comb step(k:U8) -> (r:U8) {   // locate_error_here
  r = k
}
